      ],
      "source": "https://hometownhistorymaps.com/pages/history-of-west-manchester-ohio"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Historic map prints let West Manchester residents turn their town’s past into wall art, preserving local heritage in a visual format.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        1,
        6
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://hometownhistorymaps.com/pages/history-of-west-manchester-ohio"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "The West Manchester Historical Association displays these maps at events, offering residents a tangible glimpse into the village’s early days.",
